==============================================================================
  Experiment 06 -- complete
==============================================================================
  L1 ship: valid_next_with_stats returns TokenChoice objects
    with arity / depth_delta / terminating / effects / cost.
  L2 ship: trap anomalies carry kind / detail / position_path /
    offending_op / valid_alternatives / repair_hint.
  L3 ship: static_analyze returns effects, budget bound,
    determinism, uses-of (conservation / surprise / lineage).

  Next: Exp 07 -- Claude-vs-Claude benchmark using these APIs
    as feedback signal.  Measures pass@1 delta with/without L1-L3.
